  "file": "a28_i_m_not_sure_the_price_is_important_too.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "In my view, every plant should keep its local suppliers.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a28_in_my_view_every_plant_should_keep_its_local_sup.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "The big benefit is speed.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a28_the_big_benefit_is_speed.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "I agree about the price, but speed is more important. What do you think?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a28_i_agree_about_the_price_but_speed_is_more_import.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "What do you think?",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a28_what_do_you_think.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi Rodrigo, it's Claire. Thank you for your comments on the forum. Really interesting! I agree with you about speed: local teams are faster. But I'm not sure about the price. In my view, we can buy the big ingredients in Paris and the small ones in Brazil. What do you think? Let's talk on Thursday.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a28_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi Rodrigo, Tom here. You asked my opinion about New York restaurants. In my opinion, the best pizza is in Brooklyn, not in Manhattan. Some people disagree, of course! And I think you should try a steakhouse. The steaks are expensive, but they are amazing. Really, you won't be sorry.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a28_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "The group wants to centralize purchasing in Paris. Pierre said: in my view, the benefit is the price. Ana disagreed: the downside is speed. Claire asked Rodrigo: what do you think? Rodrigo gave his opinion, and the group listened.",
